// LLM Gateway — added in Phase 5
// Folder structure:
//   gateway.js        - Main gateway with fallback chain
//   providers/        - gemini.js, groq.js, openrouter.js, ollama.js
//   prompts/          - Versioned prompt templates (*.v1.md)
//   cache.js          - MongoDB-based response cache
//   quota.js          - Per-user and global quota tracker
//   piiMasker.js      - PII masking before LLM calls
//   schemas/          - Zod schemas for LLM output validation
